entries[256301] = { ["name"] = "Sanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nGilded Plume , Ancient Blood Pigment , Coagulated Miasma (50), Crimson Ink (30), Viridescent Ink (15), Expulsom (10)\nCraft a Sanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel.\nQuest:\nA Test of Quills\nZone:\nZuldazar\n\nSanguine Feather Quill of Lana'thel\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nAllows for the creation of Blood Contracts.\nUse: Siphons the blood of the dead around you, restoring your own health in the process.\n50\nRequires Kul Tiran Inscription\n(150)\n\"It was never known if Lana'thel was the orignal designer of the quill, or merely the inspiration behind its design.\"" }
