entries[256703] = { ["name"] = "Jewelhammer's Focus", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nTools: Jeweler's Tools\nReagents:\nSweete's Diamond-Studded Spyglass , Unrefined Azerite Geode , Fine Azerite Powder (50), Kraken's Eye (5), Expulsom (10)\nCut a focusing lens.\nQuest:\nThe Missing Chapter\nZone:\nTiragarde Sound\n\nQuest:\nThe Missing Chapter\nZone:\nZuldazar\n\nJewelhammer's Focus\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nAllows the holder to interact with shrines around Kul Tiras and Zandalar, focusing the light from the zone through the lens in order to create a geode of gems.\nUse: Using the focus, carefully extract an embedded gem from one of your socketed items.\n50\nRequires Kul Tiran Jewelcrafting\n(150)" }
